    <!-- The library's info sheet (feedback round 45) -->
    <string name="library_info_title">How the library works</string>
    <string name="library_info_hint">Tap the info button at the top to read this again.</string>
    <string name="library_info_files">Your own music files</string>
    <string name="library_info_files_1">Add folder picks a folder on this phone. Track Record reads every song file in it and its subfolders, with title, artist, album and year from the files\' tags. Rescan (the arrow at the top) picks up files added, changed or removed since.</string>
    <string name="library_info_files_2">A song needs a year to come up in a game. Songs without one get it from MusicBrainz (see below), or you enter it on the song\'s page.</string>
    <string name="library_info_streamed">Songs from Deezer and Spotify</string>
    <string name="library_info_streamed_1">Add Deezer playlist: paste the link of a public Deezer playlist (Share → Copy link in the Deezer app). Its songs play as 30-second previews from Deezer.</string>
    <string name="library_info_streamed_2">Import song list: Spotify playlists are exported as a file with Exportify, which opens in your browser. Other lists work too: a CSV file with title and artist columns, or a text file with one "Artist - Title" per line. The songs are looked up on Deezer and play as its previews.</string>
    <string name="library_info_streamed_3">Songs you also have as files always play from the file. Streamed songs need an internet connection during the game.</string>
    <string name="library_info_years">Years and verification</string>
    <string name="library_info_years_1">The year decides where a song belongs, so it should be the year the song first came out. File tags often hold the year of a later album or compilation instead.</string>
    <string name="library_info_years_2">Verify by name looks up each song on MusicBrainz by artist and title and takes its earliest release. Verify by fingerprint also recognises your files by their sound (AcoustID), which finds songs with missing or wrong tags; it takes longer. Streamed songs are verified by name.</string>
    <string name="library_info_years_3">When the tags and MusicBrainz disagree, Settings → When sources disagree decides which year counts. You can correct any year on the song\'s page.</string>
    <string name="library_info_playlists">Playlists</string>
    <string name="library_info_playlists_1">Long-press songs to select them, then add them to a playlist. Each Deezer playlist and imported list becomes a playlist of its own.</string>
    <string name="library_info_playlists_2">In New game you choose which playlists the songs come from. Local files and Streamed songs hold all songs of their kind; Excluded songs never come up in a game.</string>
